          <span class="text-2xl">🔄</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-medium text-purple-400 mb-2">What is GitOps?</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">
            GitOps is a way of managing infrastructure and deployments where <span class="text-primary font-medium">Git is the single source of truth</span>. 
            Instead of running <code class="text-purple-400">kubectl apply</code> manually, you update a Git repo and an automated 
            system syncs the cluster to match.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- GitOps Flow Diagram -->
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 160" class="w-full h-auto min-w-[480px]">
