      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-bg-main rounded-lg p-4">
          <h4 class="text-sm font-medium text-purple-400 mb-2">Push-based (Traditional CD)</h4>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">Pipeline runs <code>kubectl apply</code>. CI system needs cluster credentials.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-main rounded-lg p-4 border border-primary/30">
          <h4 class="text-sm font-medium text-primary mb-2">Pull-based (GitOps)</h4>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">Agent in cluster pulls changes from Git. No external credentials needed.</p>
        </div>
